      "text": "```\nWELL-FORMED FORMULAS (WFF):\n  Atoms: p, q, r, ... (propositional variables)\n  Compound: ¬φ, (φ ∧ ψ), (φ ∨ ψ), (φ → ψ), (φ ↔ ψ)"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-LOGIC.md#009",
      "path": [
        "01-LOGIC.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:philosophy:01-logic, git-history:philosophy:01-logic]",
        "canonical_path": "philosophy/01-LOGIC.md",
        "concepts": "[logic]",
