        "root_concepts": "[logic]",
        "section": "philosophy",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "01 - Logic",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "TAUTOLOGY: true under all valuations (¬(p ∧ ¬p), p ∨ ¬p, (p → q) ↔ (¬q → ¬p))\nCONTRADICTION: false under all valuations (p ∧ ¬p)\nSATISFIABLE: true under some valuation"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-LOGIC.md#011",
      "path": [
        "01-LOGIC.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
